The '''Palm of Resourcefulness''' can be found inside the [[Path of Crondis]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. The plant must be watered from the nearby waterfalls before players can proceed and fight [[Zebak]]. In addition, [[Crocodile (Tombs of Amascut)|crocodiles]] may come attack it to hinder its growth.

Though it is possible to use a filled [[watering can]] or [[Gricoller's can]] on the Palm rather than a filled [[Water container (Tombs of Amascut)|water container]], doing so only gives 1 hitpoint towards the palm's growth, and in the case of the Gricoller's can drains ten charges instead of the usual one, allowing for a maximum of 100 uses before requiring refilling.

